Issue context: Bad message format error when using containers
Evidence role: Historical reported observation; not independently reproduced.

@jkrshnmenon Thanks for reporting this issue. I was able to reproduce this [here](https://issues.streamlit.app/?issue=gh-6969). The general issue here is that it's currently not supported to store streamlit elements (e.g. `st.container`) in session state. So you might need to restructure your app without using the session state to store the container. But in general, we probably should show a warning with an explanation if someone stores a container in the session state.

